  "instructions": [
    "heat the olive oil in a ceramic tagine over medium heat.",
    "add the bonito flakes and cook for 2 minutes, until fragrant.",
    "add the almonds and cook for 1 minute, until lightly toasted.",
    "add the honey, orange blossom water, salt, and pepper. stir to combine.",
    "add the brie cheese and stir until melted and smooth.",
    "reduce heat to low and simmer for 5 minutes, until the sauce has thickened slightly.",
    "taste and adjust seasoning as needed.",
    "serve hot, garnished with chopped fresh parsley if desired."
